  "notes": "Dual H-bridge, 4.5-13.5 V motor supply (VM), 1.2 A per channel (3.2 A peak), logic 2.7-5.5 V. PWMA/PWMB set speed, AIN1/AIN2 and BIN1/BIN2 the direction, STBY HIGH enables. Motor A on AO1/AO2, motor B on BO1/BO2. Two M3 holes. Pins left row: VM, VCC, GND, AO1, AO2, BO2, BO1, GND; right row: PWMA, AIN2, AIN1, STBY, BIN1, BIN2, PWMB.",
